data: {"role":"assistant","content":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\n<think></think>\\n现在我需要创建一个搜索和筛选区域组件：\\n\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-eb57973d40224e00ab28d3284ee39697\",\"name\":\"propose_file\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"src/components/SearchAndFilter.tsx\",\"kind\":\"file\",\"description\":\"搜索框和筛选区域组件，包含搜索输入框和三个筛选下拉选项\",\"content\":\"import React from 'react';\\nimport {\\n  SearchInput,\\n  Dropdown,\\n  Row,\\n  Col\\n} from '@fta/components';\\nimport { FilterOption, FilterState } from '../types/driver';\\n\\ninterface SearchAndFilterProps {\\n  searchKeyword: string;\\n  onSearchChange: (value: string) => void;\\n  filters: FilterState;\\n  onFilterChange: (key: string, value: any) => void;\\n  filterOptions: FilterOption[];\\n}\\n\\nconst SearchAndFilter: React.FC<SearchAndFilterProps> = ({\\n  searchKeyword,\\n  onSearchChange,\\n  filters,\\n  onFilterChange,\\n  filterOptions\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <div style={{ \\n      padding: '16px 24px', \\n      backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF',\\n      borderBottom: '1px solid #F0F0F0'\\n    }}>\\n      {/* 搜索框 */}\\n      <SearchInput\\n        placeholder=\\\"请输入司机姓名/车牌号\\\"\\n        value={searchKeyword}\\n        onChange={onSearchChange}\\n        style={{ \\n          marginBottom: '16px',\\n          height: '72px'\\n        }}\\n      />\\n      \\n      {/* 筛选选项 */}\\n      <Row gutter={0} justify=\\\"space-between\\\">\\n        {filterOptions.map(option => (\\n          <Col span={8} key={option.key}>\\n            <Dropdown\\n              title={option.title}\\n              selected={filters[option.key as keyof typeof filters]}\\n              onSelect={(value) => onFilterChange(option.key, value)}\\n              style={{\\n                height: '80px',\\n                backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF',\\n                border: 'none'\\n              }}\\n            />\\n          </Col>\\n        ))}\\n      </Row>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nexport default SearchAndFilter;\"},\"description\":\"登记 file：src/components/SearchAndFilter.tsx\"}]","uuid":"9279a363-48e2-4df9-a749-e15009e9462e","parentUuid":"05c7ccdd-b24c-488f-b24f-df72308200b4","timestamp":"2025-11-11T12:02:04.835Z"}

